cff-version: 1.2.0
title: korallen-dhw-sandbox
message: If you use this sandbox, please cite it and the underlying papers.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Römer
    given-names: Johann
    affiliation: "MOR Research Collective"
repository-code: https://github.com/GenesisAeon/korallen-dhw-sandbox
url: https://github.com/GenesisAeon/korallen-dhw-sandbox
license: MIT
version: "0.3.1"
abstract: >
  Interactive NOAA Coral Reef Watch Degree Heating Week (DHW) bleaching
  sandbox using published constants from coral-reef-utac (P114): DHW
  0–20 °C-weeks with five alert levels, four global bleaching events
  (21% → 37% → 68% → 84.4%), Hughes 2018 6-year return interval, GCRMN
  2025 5–6 year recovery window, Guillermic 2021 heat/acidification
  synergy, Walker 2023 genotype honesty check. No UTAC/CREP/AFET bridge
  and no invented Gamma value.
keywords:
  - GenesisAeon
  - P114
  - coral-reef
  - bleaching
  - DHW
  - NOAA
  - open-science
